# Filfox.info blocks automated requests (returns 500/503)
# but links work fine in browsers
https://filfox.info

# tecadmin.net throttles automated requests (times out in CI)
# but the page loads fine in browsers
https://tecadmin.net

# docs.gelato.cloud returns 404 for every path, including its own root and
# sitemap.xml (verified 2026-09 with a browser User-Agent). docs.gelato.network
# redirects here and 404s too, so there is no working replacement URL to link.
# Unlike the entries above, these links are genuinely dead rather than blocked
# by bot protection -- the vendor's docs site is down, so this suppresses real
# 404s until Gelato restores it.
https://docs.gelato.cloud

# app.goldsky.com loads in browsers and curl, but lychee's HTTP client fails
# every request with "HTTP/2 protocol error" (verified 2026-11 with lychee 0.24).
https://app.goldsky.com

# GitBook keeps dots in heading IDs ("Filecoin vs. ..." -> "#filecoin-vs.-..."),
# and the live site uses exactly these IDs, but lychee's fragment check drops
# the dot and reports them missing. The links are correct.
filecoin-compared-to\.md#filecoin-vs\.-amazon-s3-google-cloud-storage
filecoin-compared-to\.md#filecoin-tokens-fil-vs\.-bitcoin-tokens-btc
